          'The strongest defense of VRS is not perfection. It is auditability. The code, inputs, standings detail pages and rules are public enough for teams to reproduce much of the pipeline and contest concrete behavior. The strongest improvement would be equally concrete: publish versioned parameter documentation, snapshot cut-off rules and calibration reports alongside each monthly release so that governance changes are as legible as model changes.',
