          'The 10% field share is not decorative. Thirty-two teams, early Swiss best-of-ones, a month of results still to enter VRS, and possible roster changes create genuine paths for an unlisted champion. FUT’s 7% recognizes Paris and favourable MOUZ history. FURIA’s 10% respects a Cologne final and stable roster. MOUZ’s 13% sits above both because its title, VRS and Porto result are broader than one matchup. The correct headline is therefore not “Spirit will win Singapore.” It is “Spirit are the least unlikely winner in a field that owns 77%.”',
